@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC16 Quan ly nguoi dung

actor "Admin / SuperAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - UsersPage va UserFormModal" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nUsersController + UserService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nUserRepository + RoleRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach nguoi dung
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc phan trang
Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen AdminOnly
Business -> DataAccess: Doc user kem role
DataAccess -> Database: Doc User va Role
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra du lieu
Business --> UI: Hien thi danh sach

alt Tao hoac cap nhat user
  Actor -> UI: Nhap tai khoan, role va trang thai
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau luu
  Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra username, email va role
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc User va Role lien quan
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
  alt Du lieu hop le
    Business -> Business: Bam mat khau neu co
    Business -> DataAccess: Ghi User
    DataAccess -> Database: Tao hoac cap nhat user
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra user da luu
  else Trung username/email hoac role khong ton tai
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
else Xoa user
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau xoa
  Business -> DataAccess: Tim va xoa User
  DataAccess -> Database: Xoa user neu rang buoc cho phep
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan hoac loi tham chieu
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
end
UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach hoac hien thi loi
@enduml
